  "method": "curl only, no credentials, Python orchestration around curl subprocess calls. 24 runs alternating gap_tea_ds04 (odd run numbers) and gap_chips_ds07 (even), each with a fresh X-Taal-Visitor: evid-<n> header (n = run number) so every run had its own sandbox. For each run: GET /policy, POST /rerun {gap_id, policy_text} with the policy text unchanged (202 with run_id and deadline_s 90), then GET /rerun/{run_id} with the same visitor header every 5 s up to 120 s until status != running. Concurrency capped at 2 in flight (a pool of two workers); service is scale-to-zero. Model id read from GET /health (vertex check detail). Pass = result.planner_source == 'model' and result.status == 'proposed'. elapsed_s is the planner's elapsed_ms from the done payload. Nothing was dropped or repeated inside the 24; the two retries are listed separately."
}
